# Build context hygiene — keep the image build fast and correct.
# node_modules MUST be excluded: the Dockerfile reinstalls deps in-image,
# and a stray local copy would clobber it via `COPY . .`.
**/node_modules
**/.next
**/dist
**/.turbo
**/*.tsbuildinfo

.git
.github
.changeset
docs

# Test / tooling artifacts
**/coverage
**/playwright-report
**/test-results
**/.vitest-cache

# Local env + editor + OS
**/.env
**/.env.*
!**/.env.example
.vscode
.idea
**/.DS_Store
**/*.log
